mdglass (0.1.0-11) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Refresh Flatpak's offline dependency manifest from Cargo.lock and include
    a regeneration script to keep future dependency changes reproducible.
  * Make the heading/table pagination regression fixture font-independent.
  * Publish compatibility-built Linux assets requiring glibc 2.35 or newer.

 -- Rafal Okninski <hpn777@gmail.com>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:00:00 +0000

mdglass (0.1.0-10) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Native printing and GUI/headless PDF export share point-based pagination.
    Tables wrap without truncation, repeat headers and identifier columns,
    and support horizontal bands and synchronized oversized-row fragments.
  * Vector diagrams fit pages or tile with overlap and continuation labels.
    GUI export runs in a cancellable background worker on a source snapshot.
  * Protect input files and existing destinations, including redirected stdin;
    audit native bindings, SVG resources, clipping and GUI callback lifetimes.
  * Add PDF inspection, print/PDF equivalence, cancellation and concurrent GUI
    regression tests. Reuse system graphics libraries without new Cargo deps.

 -- Rafal Okninski <hpn777@gmail.com>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 10:49:55 +0000

mdglass (0.1.0-9) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The terminal pager draws ```mermaid blocks as box art: flowcharts,
    state diagrams, ER models (with a Relationships list), sequence
    diagrams and pie charts. On by default; `D` toggles art and source,
    --no-diagrams starts with source, and piped output keeps the
    markdown. A diagram that cannot be drawn truthfully at the terminal
    width — or uses syntax the drawing cannot represent exactly — stays
    a code block: the art never drops, invents or moves an element.

 -- Rafal Okninski <hpn777@gmail.com>  Sat, 07 Nov 2026 23:20:02 +0000

mdglass (0.1.0-8) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Review-pass fixes: the changelog history truncated by two release
    scripts is restored; a wedged mmdr fallback can no longer freeze the
    window (5 s deadline, capped output, plain-invocation retry for CLIs
    without -t); the shipped unicode demo box closes properly; examples
    ship under /usr/share/doc/mdglass/examples.

