mdglass (0.1.0-7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Diagram pictures follow the light/dark style: mermaid renders with
    the matching palette (a #333333 canvas in dark mode) instead of a
    baked-in light one, in-process and through the mmdr fallback alike;
    a live style switch repaints the pictures.

