mdglass (0.1.0-5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The window draws ```mermaid blocks and untyped box-art blocks as vector
    pictures (aasvg + mermaid-rs-renderer in-process, an installed mmdr CLI
    as second opinion); anything that cannot be drawn stays a code block.
    Terminal output is unchanged.

